:"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4303","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"}]}],"start":0,"end":298}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Suits]] cornered [[Lok Lambert]] in front of it just as Dante returned from the supermarket with groceries. After Dante fought them off, he invited Lok into his house so that he could study [[Eathon's journal]]. Here, Dante then explained about [[the Organization]], the [[Huntik Foundation]], [[Seekers]], and [[Titans]] to Lok. However, [[DeFoe]], [[Grier]], and the [[Suits]] cornered them inside of it. {{source|A Seeker is Born}} Dante then revealed to Lok that his house was well fortified with Foundation technology and a magical barrier since it is considered to be a Huntik Foundation base. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n{{Clear}}","text":"Suits cornered Lok Lambert in front of it just as Dante returned from the supermarket with groceries. After Dante fought them off, he invited Lok into his house so that he could study Eathon's journal. Here, Dante then explained about the Organization, the Huntik Foundation, Seekers, and Titans to Lok. However, DeFoe, Grier, and the Suits cornered them inside of it. [A Seeker is Born] Dante then revealed to Lok that his house was well fortified with Foundation technology and a magical barrier since it is considered to be a Huntik Foundation base. [The Casterwill Client]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E24 Dante.jpg\nS1E24 Dante house Professor.jpg|The living room after being ransacked by [[the Organization]]\nS2E34 Cherit Lok Den Chess Dantes house.png|[[Lok]], [[Cherit]] and [[Den]] playing chess in the courtyard\nS2E34 Cherit Sophie Lok Holotome.png\nS1E04 Dante's house Holotome.png\nS1E14 Dante address.png|Dante's address as seen on a parcel\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Houses]]\n[[Category:Venice, Italy]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation bases]]","text":"S1E24 Dante.jpg\nS1E24 Dante house Professor.jpg|The living room after being ransacked by the Organization\nS2E34 Cherit Lok Den Chess Dantes house.png|Lok, Cherit and Den playing chess in the courtyard\nS2E34 Cherit Sophie Lok Holotome.png\nS1E04 Dante's house Holotome.png\nS1E14 Dante address.png|Dante's address as seen on a parcel"}],"full_text":"Dante's house is where Dante Vale lives in Venice, Italy. Dante's house has several floors with large, extravagant rooms as well as a rooftop deck. As his house seves as a base of operations for the Huntik Foundation, the house is fortified with Foundation technology and magic.\n== History ==\nSuits cornered Lok Lambert in front of it just as Dante returned from the supermarket with groceries. After Dante fought them off, he invited Lok into his house so that he could study Eathon's journal. Here, Dante then explained about the Organization, the Huntik Foundation, Seekers, and Titans to Lok. However, DeFoe, Grier, and the Suits cornered them inside of it. [A Seeker is Born] Dante then revealed to Lok that his house was well fortified with Foundation technology and a magical barrier since it is considered to be a Huntik Foundation base. [The Casterwill Client]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E24 Dante.jpg\nS1E24 Dante house Professor.jpg|The living room after being ransacked by the Organization\nS2E34 Cherit Lok Den Chess Dantes house.png|Lok, Cherit and Den playing chess in the courtyard\nS2E34 Cherit Sophie Lok Holotome.png\nS1E04 Dante's house Holotome.png\nS1E14 Dante address.png|Dante's address as seen on a parcel","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox location\n| image       = Dante's house.png\n| type        = House\n| level       = 4\n| first appearance = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n| location    = [[Venice, Italy]]\n| inhabitants = [[Cherit]]<br>[[Dante Vale]]<br>[[Den Fears]]<br>[[Lok Lambert]]<br>[[Sophie Casterwill]]<br>[[Zhalia Moon]]\n}}'''Dante's house''' is where [[Dante Vale]] lives in [[Venice, Italy]]. Dante's house has several floors with large, extravagant rooms as well as a rooftop deck. As his house seves as a base of operations for the [[Huntik Foundation]], the house is fortified with Foundation technology and magic.\n== History ==\n[[Suits]] cornered [[Lok Lambert]] in front of it just as Dante returned from the supermarket with groceries. After Dante fought them off, he invited Lok into his house so that he could study [[Eathon's journal]]. Here, Dante then explained about [[the Organization]], the [[Huntik Foundation]], [[Seekers]], and [[Titans]] to Lok. However, [[DeFoe]], [[Grier]], and the [[Suits]] cornered them inside of it. {{source|A Seeker is Born}} Dante then revealed to Lok that his house was well fortified with Foundation technology and a magical barrier since it is considered to be a Huntik Foundation base. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n{{Clear}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E24 Dante.jpg\nS1E24 Dante house Professor.jpg|The living room after being ransacked by [[the Organization]]\nS2E34 Cherit Lok Den Chess Dantes house.png|[[Lok]], [[Cherit]] and [[Den]] playing chess in the courtyard\nS2E34 Cherit Sophie Lok Holotome.png\nS1E04 Dante's house Holotome.png\nS1E14 Dante address.png|Dante's address as seen on a parcel\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Houses]]\n[[Category:Venice, Italy]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation bases]]","categories":["Houses","Huntik Foundation bases","Locations","Venice, Italy"],"links":[{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_title":"Cherit","label":"Cherit","target_id":"huntik:page:2019","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cherit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2019"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4303","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolv